abstract: >-
  Command-line tool that builds an auditable literature corpus: OpenAlex discovery,
  SCImago 2010-2025 venue enrichment (SJR, quartiles, categories, estimated APC) at the
  publication year and the latest snapshot, policy-based screening of a main corpus with
  a recorded reason for every exclusion, retraction flags and venue tiers from a
  user-maintained list, and polite download of open-access full text.
